WEBVTT

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.810
That's where I used to live.

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:15.360
That's the lake I always looked at.

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:18.820
Below that is Takeru's lodging, the place we were just at.

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:22.950
Beyond that is a town where lots of people live.

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:26.160
Yeah. The world is big!

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:29.960
<i>Gee, how sweet and innocent.</i>

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:31.310
<i>Fine, fine.</i>

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.860
<i>I'm more generous than I look.</i>

00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:37.300
<i>When it's time to bare yourself, I'll strip anything!</i>

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Well now, prepare yourself.</i>

00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:46.620
Whisper goodbye to the unsightly world,.

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:53.370
and embellish its entirety with those crimson wings.

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:06.540
The filthier this world becomes,.

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:10.720
the dearer its living things are.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:18.250
The more I hate it, the stronger my desire to embrace it.

00:01:18.790 --> 00:01:24.910
Staring intently at a mirror reveals my dark side.

00:01:25.590 --> 00:01:30.630
People hide their weaknesses,.

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:37.830
by hurting those who are kind.

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:44.770
Whisper goodbye to the unsightly world,.

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:50.290
and dance around it gloriously with those crimon wings.

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:53.840
Please kiss me passionately,.

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:56.620
as often as you want,.

00:01:56.970 --> 00:02:02.810
if you notice my heart raging violently.

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:09.330
So I might change once more.

00:02:15.390 --> 00:02:17.850
These clothes are... mine?

00:02:18.390 --> 00:02:21.520
Sorry, it took a while to finish.

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:23.440
But what do you think? It's cute, isn't it?

00:02:23.730 --> 00:02:25.310
Yup, it's cute!

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:27.230
Nobody asked you guys anything.

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:30.460
Well, like they say, "clothes make the woman".

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:34.130
This thing's... probably happy, right?

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:37.680
Hey, if Akari has one of these...

00:02:38.430 --> 00:02:40.060
Hikari should also have one, right?

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:43.600
Yeah, I wonder if she has one somewhere.

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:45.060
We're done here, too!

00:02:50.150 --> 00:02:51.150
How is it?

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:53.900
Wow! You're looking great as well!

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:56.410
Sis, those clothes...

00:02:56.740 --> 00:02:59.870
I'm going to start school tomorrow.

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:00.990
School?

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:01.640
Yes!

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:04.410
But she sure went through the transfer process easily...

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:05.790
You're right...

00:03:05.770 --> 00:03:07.940
There's no need to worry about that.

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:11.110
Just let me handle everything.

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:14.650
Because nothing is impossible for me.

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:16.030
Who are you?

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:19.030
You seem happy.

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:19.670
Yes!

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:21.870
Everyone goes to school.

00:03:22.620 --> 00:03:24.250
I believe it is a fun place.

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:29.710
There are sure to be new encounters waiting for me there.

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:36.300
Are you nervous?

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:37.130
Y-Yes.

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:39.720
It's my first time going to school.

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:42.550
I don't think you should expect that much from it...

00:03:42.810 --> 00:03:44.520
Don't be so negative...

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:47.390
I've talked about it with her before.

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:52.230
You have to be careful.

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:53.570
S-Sorry.

00:03:55.190 --> 00:03:57.150
Even walking seems troublesome, doesn't it?

00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:01.120
It's okay, I like to walk.

00:04:01.830 --> 00:04:04.580
You can see lots of different colors when you walk.

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:05.500
Colors?

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:06.180
Yes.

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:10.710
Well, like here, there, and over there.

00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:14.800
You can see a lot of colors that can't be seen around the house.

00:04:15.340 --> 00:04:17.340
Is that so?

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:18.160
That's Hikari, all right.

00:04:19.550 --> 00:04:20.510
Well, let's go.

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:21.390
Okay.

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:25.060
<i>I wonder what kind of colors the school has...?</i>

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:28.810
This is school...?

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:32.980
Far fewer colors than the town had...

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:34.980
You're probably right about that.

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:36.450
You.

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:38.070
Yeah, I mean you.

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:39.700
What's with that hair color?

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:42.990
Dying your hair that kind of color goes against the school rules.

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:44.480
This is Hikari's natural hair color.

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:49.410
Geez, what was that all of a sudden?

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:52.170
Don't worry though, not everyone here is like that.

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:53.500
Okay.

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:02.810
Hikari.

00:05:04.090 --> 00:05:04.810
Yes.

00:05:08.730 --> 00:05:10.810
I will introduce you to our transfer student.

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:13.150
My name is Hikari Hoshino.

00:05:13.820 --> 00:05:14.770
Cute!

00:05:14.820 --> 00:05:15.650
Where are you from?

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:21.030
Pleased to meet you all.

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:24.830
So "Hoshino" is the surname she came up with.

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:27.240
Note: "Hoshino" literally means "from the stars".

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:27.240
It doesn't stray that much from her image.

00:05:27.240 --> 00:05:30.210
Indeed. It has a nice ring to it.

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:34.380
Please ask the class representative if you need anything.

00:05:34.960 --> 00:05:35.960
Yoshida!

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:36.860
Yes.

00:05:40.220 --> 00:05:41.800
Um, over here.

00:05:43.890 --> 00:05:46.100
I'm Mayu Yoshida. Nice to meet you.

00:05:46.220 --> 00:05:47.760
Nice to meet you too.

00:05:55.110 --> 00:05:57.610
<i>Speaking as myself, not as God,.</i>

00:05:58.150 --> 00:05:59.690
<i>nor as Buddha,.</i>

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:02.070
<i>my voice, without any of the extraordinary,.</i>

00:06:02.610 --> 00:06:06.160
<i>as an extraordinary thing, confirming one's frailty.</i>

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:08.740
<i>And a fate that made it so.</i>

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:22.090
<i>Now, I have assumed the form of a frail human, and I speak to you now,.</i>

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:28.680
<i>not as God of as Buddha, but as an empty man. And though I have a heart that differs from a human-</i>

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:32.930
Ryou-sama!

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:34.940
Please don't shout in the hallways!

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:39.190
Not quite what you had in mind?

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:41.690
Hey!

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:43.360
But it's written all over her face.

00:06:43.820 --> 00:06:45.320
A disappointed look.

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:48.830
Um, is... is that true? Are you disappointed?

00:06:50.040 --> 00:06:51.830
Damn you, Takeru!

00:06:51.910 --> 00:06:53.790
Hikari is disappointed!?

00:06:53.790 --> 00:06:56.880
What did you do? I won't forgive you. I won't!

00:06:57.420 --> 00:06:58.790
That's not it!

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:03.130
I was just asking if it was a little different from what she imagined, that's all.

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:21.270
I always thought school was a place that was vibrant and radiant each day, overflowing with cheerfulness.

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:22.880
But...

00:07:23.190 --> 00:07:25.950
It's certainly not just a place like that.

00:07:26.360 --> 00:07:30.080
Hmm... It's kinda like Wiener Coffee.

00:07:30.870 --> 00:07:33.000
Bitter, yet there's a certain sweetness to it as well.

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:35.080
Ooh, that's rather philosophical.

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:36.870
You can't ask for sweetness alone.

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:38.040
Right?

00:07:39.130 --> 00:07:40.120
Well...

00:07:40.130 --> 00:07:41.130
I guess...

00:07:41.380 --> 00:07:43.420
I don't quite get it yet.

00:07:44.260 --> 00:07:49.470
Well, for me, it's like playing the same game over and over again.

00:07:50.260 --> 00:07:54.390
Well, we have to attend school every day, right?

00:07:55.180 --> 00:07:59.480
That's kinda like playing the same game over and over again.

00:07:59.480 --> 00:08:01.310
I guess it's something like that...

00:08:01.810 --> 00:08:07.350
If we could get a new school, I wonder if it'd feel like a new game?

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:10.360
If so, we should first get some new girls!

00:08:10.360 --> 00:08:11.900
Oh! That's a good idea!

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:13.280
Morons!

00:08:13.610 --> 00:08:16.780
So school is really... like that...

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:18.990
No! Um...

00:08:18.990 --> 00:08:20.450
I don't feel that way.

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:24.540
I get to eat lunch with everyone every day.

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:26.410
That's just like you.

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:32.040
I'm sorry. I should've told you beforehand what school was all about.

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:34.340
Well, that's how it is.

00:08:34.800 --> 00:08:39.380
But, as long as you don't expect too much, you should be fine.

00:08:40.220 --> 00:08:45.640
Then... why does everyone come to school every day?

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:50.270
Do all the people that go to school like it?

00:08:51.020 --> 00:08:52.480
Or do they hate it?

00:08:58.990 --> 00:09:00.820
She's pretty good for a first-timer!

00:09:05.330 --> 00:09:06.040
Oh my.

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:09.460
Mayu.

00:09:12.290 --> 00:09:14.920
Thanks. But I'm all right.

00:09:21.590 --> 00:09:24.260
<i>Attention: We will now perform an evacuation drill.</i>

00:09:31.690 --> 00:09:33.190
Um, this is...?

00:09:33.520 --> 00:09:35.770
Didn't you hear about it during homeroom?

00:09:35.770 --> 00:09:37.650
Don't worry. It's only a drill.

00:09:38.900 --> 00:09:40.200
Come, follow me.

00:09:40.650 --> 00:09:41.240
Ah, okay.

00:09:42.070 --> 00:09:43.490
This sucks...

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:46.050
We have to line up in these clothes?

00:09:47.660 --> 00:09:49.010
Eh... What was that...

00:10:00.090 --> 00:10:00.880
Hoshino?

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:03.720
Ahh, this makes me want to ditch.

00:10:04.180 --> 00:10:05.510
Yeah, really.

00:10:10.980 --> 00:10:12.270
Form a line!

00:10:13.690 --> 00:10:14.730
Hey, where's Hikari?

00:10:15.110 --> 00:10:16.690
I thought she came with us...

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:18.480
She's not here.

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:20.690
She ran away!

00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:24.780
Takeru, you got dumped so quickly!

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:25.820
Shut up!

00:10:36.670 --> 00:10:38.880
Do you always do this?

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:42.340
I... don't do it often.

00:10:44.300 --> 00:10:46.720
"Not often" as in today's the first time.

00:10:47.760 --> 00:10:50.380
Do you think that's boring?

00:10:50.890 --> 00:10:53.480
But school is like that.

00:10:55.350 --> 00:10:57.060
But... But you know,.

00:10:57.650 --> 00:10:59.610
during our match earlier...

00:11:00.280 --> 00:11:02.240
At times like that I feel so...

00:11:02.780 --> 00:11:03.820
...uncool.

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:05.860
I hate it.

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:09.340
I wonder why they make us do that...

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:11.160
Then just don't do it.

00:11:14.370 --> 00:11:19.290
But I'm clumsy, so I have to try twice as hard as the others.

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:24.630
No... It takes all my effort just trying to keep up.

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:27.300
I keep showing my clumsy side...

00:11:28.720 --> 00:11:32.720
School is a place where everyone has to do the same thing, right?

00:11:33.480 --> 00:11:35.890
Even though some of us can't even keep up...

00:11:37.520 --> 00:11:38.060
Well?

00:11:40.230 --> 00:11:41.610
Is that fun?

00:11:43.850 --> 00:11:45.030
I...

00:11:45.950 --> 00:11:50.030
No... I hate school.

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:54.160
Then we should just tear it down.

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:10.100
Disasters such as fires and earthquakes happen without warning.

00:12:10.510 --> 00:12:16.300
But even so, I doubt your school will collapse just like tha-

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:24.220
My school...!

00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:30.070
Hikari!

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:31.990
Takeru?

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:32.990
Hikari!

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:36.580
Hikari, are you okay?

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:37.880
Yes.

00:12:38.330 --> 00:12:39.750
Why did this happen...?

00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:43.210
I don't know. I was here when I woke up.

00:12:48.260 --> 00:12:49.840
A monster!?

00:12:52.680 --> 00:12:54.680
Don't put me on the same level as those things.

00:12:55.850 --> 00:12:56.730
It spoke!

00:12:58.730 --> 00:13:01.310
Are you okay, Mistress?

00:13:02.520 --> 00:13:03.440
Excuse me?

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:12.890
Well, I'm glad nobody was hurt.

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:18.190
But Yoshida, why were you here?

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:20.400
I have no idea...

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:23.530
What? You were the one who destroyed the school!?

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:25.410
What's the meaning of this?

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:27.830
Meaning... Well...

00:13:27.970 --> 00:13:29.620
Explain yourself!

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:32.660
It's too much trouble.

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:36.290
I hate troublesome things.

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:37.960
That's good enough, right?

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:41.760
What's up with this guy?

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:43.720
Some lazy guy?

00:13:45.180 --> 00:13:46.760
Please explain clearly.

00:13:48.100 --> 00:13:49.140
Understood.

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:51.180
His attitude changed all of a sudden...

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:53.350
Well then, please hear me out.

00:13:55.390 --> 00:14:00.070
<i>Embedded in the core of my body is a crystal emitting a shiny blue light.</i>

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:04.240
<i>My intelligence and knowledge is all stored in there.</i>

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:07.990
<i>The crystal can manipulate the matter around it.</i>

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:11.410
<i>It was able to create this body, for instance.</i>

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:17.370
<i>However, after remaining dormant for some time, that crystal...</i>

00:14:17.870 --> 00:14:21.340
Before you get into that, why did you break down the school?

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:24.800
I don't think he really had that intention.

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:30.140
When he woke up, he happened to be trapped by the columns of the building...

00:14:30.140 --> 00:14:34.020
You mean he broke the column to get out?

00:14:34.020 --> 00:14:35.730
Well, that's how it happened.

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:38.600
What an annoying way to wake up...

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:40.770
You should've just kept sleeping.

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:42.020
I couldn't do that.

00:14:42.570 --> 00:14:43.980
I heard the voice of my Mistress.

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:45.280
Mistress?

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:47.950
Do you mean Hikari?

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:51.700
Your name is Hikari now?

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:53.870
Your appearance has also changed.

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:56.910
I didn't know it was you at first.

00:14:57.750 --> 00:15:01.540
So you are Hikari's... what?

00:15:02.090 --> 00:15:03.880
Something like a bodyguard?

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:06.210
That wouldn't suprise me.

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:08.720
She has a weirdo with her, too.

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:10.720
It's not a weirdo, it's Kuon.

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:15.350
Let me see it for a bit.

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:20.150
You have to be nice, okay?

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:24.480
That definitely looks like a companion of mine.

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:27.050
Haha, this one is pretty small.

00:15:29.780 --> 00:15:30.360
Ouch!

00:15:34.790 --> 00:15:40.170
Then she must be his Mistress... but I hadn't felt anything all this time...

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:42.630
Oh well.

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:46.300
I wonder if these two are also siblings?

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:55.850
You're being too friendly!

00:15:56.430 --> 00:15:58.560
What's wrong with staying close to my Mistress?

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:01.350
Did Hikari tell you to wake up?

00:16:01.400 --> 00:16:02.400
That's right.

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:04.860
I have no clue what he's talking about.

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:11.360
You sensed Hikari and acted without her telling you to...

00:16:11.910 --> 00:16:15.410
A-Anyway, I just woke up.

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:19.450
I'm not responsible for what happened at school!

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:20.830
Let's just leave it at that.

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:22.400
You...!

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:24.670
I wonder if he'll be living here too...

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:27.670
Hello!

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:29.670
New face, huh?

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:32.010
Well, whatever. Drink!

00:16:34.850 --> 00:16:35.890
Delicious!

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:40.230
You drink well! I like that!

00:16:40.980 --> 00:16:41.810
What's your name?

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:44.520
Please call me Ionius.

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:47.230
Okay, understood. Onii-tan!

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:48.600
Ionius!

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:49.340
Too long!

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:52.900
I will go to school again tomorrow.

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:56.200
But I don't think anybody will show up.

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:58.330
I feel bad about it.

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:01.580
I'd like to do whatever I can.

00:17:03.670 --> 00:17:04.290
Okay.

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:08.170
I don't know what we can do, but let's go and see.

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:10.920
Okay.

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:14.430
Seems only the workers came.

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:18.600
Ionius, please give them a hand.

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:20.520
Understood.

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:24.100
Is that going to work?

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:25.230
...so please do it this wa-

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:26.310
I'm here to help!

00:17:27.110 --> 00:17:28.440
What's this?

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:31.280
Probably some new invention?

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:32.650
Well in that case...

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:35.070
Hoshino.

00:17:37.160 --> 00:17:37.780
Yoshida.

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:40.200
Yesterday was kind of weird.

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:43.040
I don't remember much of it, but...

00:17:43.460 --> 00:17:45.210
W-Well, you're probably just...

00:17:45.210 --> 00:17:47.670
...confused from the shock.

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:49.090
Yeah, that's it!

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:51.300
That's what I thought.

00:17:52.090 --> 00:17:54.470
But I'm glad that you're okay.

00:17:54.970 --> 00:17:58.180
Sorry, I wanted to wait until you regained consciousness but...

00:18:01.100 --> 00:18:04.020
Um, why did you come to school?

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:05.190
No reason...

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:08.860
See you later.

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:11.820
I wonder why she came?

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:14.860
Hikari?

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:18.910
What are you doing?

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:22.120
Um... nothing.

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:23.040
I'll help.

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:23.980
But...

00:18:24.620 --> 00:18:25.540
It's okay.

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:33.010
Sounds fun, doesn't it?

00:18:33.550 --> 00:18:34.130
Yup.

00:18:37.180 --> 00:18:38.470
Really?

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:57.450
One, two!

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:04.870
If we don't find it soon, I'm going to collapse.

00:19:05.250 --> 00:19:05.910
Found it!

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:12.710
Thank goodness.

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:14.250
A scrapbook?

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:21.350
I made this when I was class representative last year.

00:19:21.350 --> 00:19:23.060
Is that what you were looking for?

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:23.930
Yup.

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:27.980
Looking at this brings back memories.

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:31.230
Not just the school festivals and field trips,.

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:35.360
but also things that happened when I made this and things before and after that.

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:38.320
Good times and bad times...

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:40.030
Alot of different memories.

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:43.700
Um, this is...

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:46.950
...something important to you, right?

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:50.080
By the way, they all gathered here.

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:50.830
Yeah, you're right.

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:56.050
There's a lot of people. People just like Yoshida.

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:55.130
- I'm taking it!

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:03.470
I think I understand!

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:09.810
Yoshida... no, everyone likes school, right?

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:13.730
Maybe not every aspect of it.

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:17.030
There may be things people hate about it.

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:23.780
But if good memories come from it... that means people generally like it, right?

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:30.500
Did I say something strange?

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:32.120
Nope, sorry.

00:20:32.920 --> 00:20:35.340
Yeah, it's probably just as you say.

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:39.260
Wow, there's quite a bit of people!

00:20:39.260 --> 00:20:40.050
You guys...

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:43.500
There's something I wanted to come get, so...

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:44.300
Me too.

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:47.600
Everyone came in the end.

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:50.640
I should've brought my lunch.

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:54.610
I'm going to go help some more.

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:02.820
This is causing problems!

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:04.520
We're supposed to maintain the status quo.

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:06.950
Don't be so strict.

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:10.160
These things are important to them.

00:21:10.160 --> 00:21:11.410
Cut them a little slack!

00:21:26.900 --> 00:21:27.480
Sis!

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:29.310
Why are you here?

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:33.520
It seemed fun so we decided to drop by.

00:21:38.110 --> 00:21:40.400
What's wrong? Why so glum?

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:43.300
I see.

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:47.740
Feeling like a parent who just married off her daughter?

00:21:48.330 --> 00:21:49.660
It's fine with me.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:52.660
If Hikari has found a fun place to be...

00:21:52.870 --> 00:21:54.920
So you say...

00:21:54.920 --> 00:21:57.210
...but you're not really that good-natured!

00:21:57.210 --> 00:21:58.630
You guys!

00:21:59.090 --> 00:22:00.550
Takeru, look!

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:03.340
Lots of colors.

00:22:06.090 --> 00:22:10.260
There weren't this many colors here, yesterday.

00:22:11.970 --> 00:22:14.480
Bring burnable trash over here!

00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:25.490
Lots of wonderful colors.

00:22:26.070 --> 00:22:28.030
Red, yellow and gold.

00:22:28.950 --> 00:22:30.280
There are lots of colors.

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:32.620
<i>How stupid...</i>

00:22:33.750 --> 00:22:36.330
<i>These things won't last anyway.</i>

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:40.540
<i>Everything will soon go back to the way it was.</i>

00:22:42.050 --> 00:22:43.840
<i>A boring everyday life.</i>

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:45.930
<i>That's just boring.</i>

00:22:47.220 --> 00:22:47.970
<i>What was that...</i>

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:55.310
It's a bit early, but due to circumstances, summer break will commence tomorrow!

00:22:56.690 --> 00:22:58.100
Did you hear that?!

00:22:58.100 --> 00:22:59.310
Summer break!

00:23:00.230 --> 00:23:01.520
Then what about school?

00:23:02.610 --> 00:23:06.610
There won't be school, since we're on break.

00:23:06.610 --> 00:23:11.450
Oh no, that's awful! I just started to get the good parts of school, too!

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:18.750
Don't worry. When fall comes, second semester will start right away.

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:22.710
Really? I can't wait till fall.

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:25.590
How can you think about that right now?

00:23:26.210 --> 00:23:29.260
That's right. We've got summer break before that.

00:23:29.840 --> 00:23:33.930
I'll show you a lot of other fun things besides school.

00:23:58.230 --> 00:24:04.600
The sun aims straight at us.

00:24:05.040 --> 00:24:09.650
I want a tan from the bright summer light.

00:24:10.220 --> 00:24:17.780
I wonder in what way today is going to change me.

00:24:17.780 --> 00:24:22.150
Despite some worries, it'll still be great.

00:24:23.800 --> 00:24:29.370
A part of summer bursts, jumps, and boils,.

00:24:29.670 --> 00:24:35.330
hitting the sky, ocean, and world.

00:24:35.670 --> 00:24:37.060
Hold me.

00:24:37.060 --> 00:24:43.290
What will you do when I whisper those words to you?

00:24:43.290 --> 00:24:48.000
I don't want precarious affection.

00:24:49.770 --> 00:24:56.040
Since a hunch can become truth in an instant,.

00:24:56.040 --> 00:24:59.790
in this hot season.

00:25:14.390 --> 00:25:17.550
Next Episode

00:25:16.780 --> 00:25:18.450
I'm Takeru Takemoto.

00:25:18.740 --> 00:25:22.820
Camping in the mountains over summer break is pretty normal, I know that.

00:25:23.120 --> 00:25:24.370
That's fine!

00:25:24.370 --> 00:25:28.160
We want Hikari and Akari to try ordinary things.

00:25:28.960 --> 00:25:31.040
What!? Ionius is coming along too?

00:25:31.540 --> 00:25:32.420
Jennifer, even?

00:25:33.420 --> 00:25:36.170
Next time on This Ugly and Beautiful World,.

00:25:36.170 --> 00:25:37.170
Staying by the Waterside.

00:25:37.840 --> 00:25:42.220
I sincerely hope everything's normal and nothing goes wrong.
